            "mode": "native",
            "description": "Station AutoResearchEvaluator runs the native Research Center coder/submission lifecycle and circle_n32 Task1Evaluator; validity and sum-of-radii scores remain native records, never canonical Arena receipts. Session completion requires the requested tick boundary and drained native evaluation queues.",
